  "descriptionMarkdown": "This Factorio nuclear power plant is engineered for maximum efficiency and reliability. Through precise control over fuel rod insertion, every single uranium fuel cell is utilized optimally to ensure a constant and high energy output. Overproduction of steam is meticulously avoided, and the plant dynamically adjusts its power generation to meet your factory's real-time energy demands.\n\nAn intelligent monitoring system continuously tracks reactor temperatures and steam storage levels. Fuel rods are only inserted when absolutely necessary, conserving both fuel and cooling water resources. This not only minimizes waste but also guarantees seamless and uninterrupted operation, even during fluctuating energy requirements.\n\nThe design also prioritizes scalability: the plant is built to be easily expandable as your factory's energy needs grow, without compromising its existing efficiency. You can rely on this nuclear power plant to power your most ambitious production goals.",
